<title>FRANCE: CGIP to announce Valeo stake buy Tuesday - source.</title>
<headline>CGIP to announce Valeo stake buy Tuesday - source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>French holding company CGIP will announce on Tuesday that it is buying the stake held in auto parts maker Valeo held by Cerus, industry sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>A CGIP spokeswoman, contacted by Reuters, limited herself to saying the company planned a news conference on Tuesday at 0730 GMT.</p>
</text>
